{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19064","headline":"谢柳子厚寄叠石砚 · 刘禹锡","name":"谢柳子厚寄叠石砚","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"常时同砚席，寄砚感离羣。\n清越敲寒玉，参差叠碧云。\n烟岚馀斐亹，水墨两氛氲。\n好与陶贞白，松窻写紫文。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19064.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19064","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}